        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-1790, Ornate Backplate for Small Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf small details are what brings a look together, than grandiose details help set the mood for an entire room. The Gothic Cabinet Knob Rose will be sure to add a little bit of the old world to any space. Its ornate style will add drama and a beautiful point of interest as a backplate to almost any cabinet knob. Use on kitchen cabinets, on desk drawers, or even on an antique cedar chest with cabinet knobs like the <a href=\"/products/smooth-melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3250\">Smooth Melon Cabinet Knob</a> or the <a href=\"/products/plain-knob-with-beaded-edge-rk-international-ck-9310\">Beaded Cabinet Knob</a> for a truly stunning look. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-1790, Ornate Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oil-bronze-crab.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
